# FREE-PLAY CHAIN (wip122, option B): loading a preset turns SONG ON; PLAY runs through the preset, chain after chain:
# a pattern flagged CHAINED runs into the next, the first one without the flag ends its chain and the next chain follows,
# after pattern 8 back to 1. K1 of the pattern page (SEQ 2nd press) turns SONG off (right = on): the pattern then loops.
# build/test_chain.tnp: 4 patterns, 1, 2 and 4 flagged CHAINED, 3 not (chains: 1-2-3, 4-5). 120 BPM: a bar is 2 s.
wait 300
preset build/test_chain.tnp
expect preset_rc 0
expect pchain0 1
expect pchain1 1
expect pchain2 0
expect pchain3 1
expect pchain4 0
expect pattern 1
expect chainon 1
tap PLAY
wait 1000
expect pattern 1
wait 2000
expect pattern 2
wait 2000
expect pattern 3
# 3 is not chained: the chain ends, the next chain (4) follows; 5 ends it, then 6, 7, 8, and back to 1
wait 2000
expect pattern 4
wait 2000
expect pattern 5
wait 6000
expect pattern 8
wait 2000
expect pattern 1
tap PLAY
wait 300
# PLAY from the middle of a chain starts at the chain's first pattern: FUNC + white key 2 = pattern 3 (chain 1-2-3) -> starts at 1
key b10 down
tapkey w2
key b10 up
expect pattern 3
tap PLAY
wait 500
expect pattern 1
tap PLAY
wait 300
# the pattern page: K1 left = SONG OFF, shown bottom left; the pattern loops on itself
tap SEQ
expect seqpat 1
shot chain_on.png
turn K1 -1
expect chainon 0
wait 100
shot chain_off.png
tap SEQ
expect seqpat 0
tap PLAY
wait 5000
expect pattern 1
tap PLAY
wait 300
# K1 right = SONG ON again
tap SEQ
turn K1 1
expect chainon 1
